{
 "total": 57.067,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "g00_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.048,
   "caption": "First, sit Ben in a barrel, tie on a big rock, and push."
  },
  {
   "id": "g01_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 2.067,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "caption": "Down he goes... Congratulations, you've built a submarine!"
  },
  {
   "id": "g02_0",
   "who": "ben",
   "start": 4.233,
   "dur": 1.243,
   "caption": "Mm-mmm!"
  },
  {
   "id": "g03_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 5.5,
   "dur": 1.593,
   "caption": "It can go down. It just can't come back up."
  },
  {
   "id": "g04_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 7.133,
   "dur": 2.028,
   "caption": "Water pushes up with the weight of the water you push aside."
  },
  {
   "id": "g05_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 9.2,
   "dur": 1.408,
   "caption": "The rock weighs more than that, so it sinks."
  },
  {
   "id": "g06_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 10.633,
   "dur": 2.129,
   "caption": "A beach ball weighs much less, so it pops right back up."
  },
  {
   "id": "g06_1",
   "who": "ben",
   "start": 12.792,
   "dur": 0.788,
   "caption": "Whoa-oh!"
  },
  {
   "id": "g07_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 13.633,
   "dur": 2.391,
   "caption": "So heavy things sink, light things float, and the same weight hovers."
  },
  {
   "id": "g08_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 16.067,
   "dur": 1.56,
   "caption": "So you build a sub that can change its weight,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g09_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 17.667,
   "dur": 1.188,
   "caption": "with two empty tanks on the sides."
  },
  {
   "id": "g10_0",
   "who": "ben",
   "start": 18.9,
   "dur": 1.131,
   "caption": "Fishing time!"
  },
  {
   "id": "g11_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 20.067,
   "dur": 0.822,
   "caption": "Full of air, it floats."
  },
  {
   "id": "g12_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 20.933,
   "dur": 2.069,
   "caption": "Open the vents, the tanks fill with water, and down it goes."
  },
  {
   "id": "g13_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 23.033,
   "dur": 1.462,
   "caption": "Too much water, and it sinks to the bottom."
  },
  {
   "id": "g14_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 24.533,
   "dur": 3.036,
   "caption": "Pump half the water out, and it weighs exactly as much as the water it pushes aside,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g15_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 27.6,
   "dur": 1.755,
   "caption": "so it just hangs there in the water, perfectly still."
  },
  {
   "id": "g16_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 29.4,
   "dur": 1.89,
   "caption": "A propeller at the back pushes it along, past the weeds."
  },
  {
   "id": "g17_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 31.333,
   "dur": 1.402,
   "caption": "And a periscope pokes up to look around."
  },
  {
   "id": "g18_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 32.767,
   "dur": 1.514,
   "caption": "And who's that up there? It's the neighbour, fishing."
  },
  {
   "id": "g19_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 34.3,
   "dur": 1.226,
   "caption": "Then his fishing hook snags the sub."
  },
  {
   "id": "g20_0",
   "who": "neighbour",
   "start": 35.567,
   "dur": 0.721,
   "caption": "Big one!"
  },
  {
   "id": "g21_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 36.333,
   "dur": 1.546,
   "caption": "Ben drives off, towing him across the lake."
  },
  {
   "id": "g22_0",
   "who": "neighbour",
   "start": 37.933,
   "dur": 1.398,
   "caption": "Biggest catch of my life!"
  },
  {
   "id": "g23_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 39.367,
   "dur": 2.913,
   "caption": "Deeper down, the water presses harder, one more atmosphere every ten metres."
  },
  {
   "id": "g24_0",
   "who": "ben",
   "start": 42.333,
   "dur": 1.933,
   "caption": "It's getting tight in here... AAAH!"
  },
  {
   "id": "g25_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 44.3,
   "dur": 1.507,
   "caption": "So Ben blows the tanks with compressed air,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g26_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 45.833,
   "dur": 1.495,
   "caption": "now it's lighter than the water, and up it shoots,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g27_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 47.367,
   "dur": 1.602,
   "caption": "right up under the neighbour's little boat. Oops."
  },
  {
   "id": "g28_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 49.0,
   "dur": 1.075,
   "caption": "Empty tanks: it floats again."
  },
  {
   "id": "g29_0",
   "who": "neighbour",
   "start": 50.1,
   "dur": 1.392,
   "caption": "Worst fishing trip ever."
  },
  {
   "id": "g30_0",
   "who": "narrator",
   "start": 51.533,
   "dur": 2.3,
   "caption": "And there you have it. Congratulations, you've built a submarine!"
  },
  {
   "id": "g31_0",
   "who": "grandma",
   "start": 53.867,
   "dur": 1.95,
   "caption": "You know they sell snorkels, dear?"
  },
  {
   "id": "g32_0",
   "who": "ben",
   "start": 55.867,
   "dur": 1.173,
   "caption": "Now you tell me."
  }
 ],
